  "description": "Run the pinned non-regression procedure after the pilot cutover and commit the receipt showing the tolerance holds.\n\n## Background\n\nThe pinned procedure and its predeclared tolerance exist before the cutover; this issue executes it on the prepared benchmark host after the pilot cutover lands and commits the receipt comparing against the baseline. The issue completes only once a receipt shows the tolerance holds. An excursion encountered on the way is preserved in the committed record together with its tracked rework, never overwritten.\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- [hard] REQ-01: A committed receipt compares post-cutover measurements against the baseline with full provenance and shows the predeclared tolerance holds for the pinned set.\n- [hard] REQ-02: Any tolerance excursion encountered before the passing run is preserved in the committed record with its contradiction and tracked rework.",
